{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["who gave His sons a perfect law, who brings to light every hidden thing — may He grant us understanding of a matter of wisdom inscribed in the section ויקחו לי תרומה." "<b>וידבר.</b> Upon his ascent to the top of the mountain, He spoke to him concerning the matter of the Tabernacle — the reason being that they should make a sanctuary for the honored Name and He would dwell within it, and there He would speak with Moses, and he would not ascend the mountain:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:38:04.699383348Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}